{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_03_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_03","title":"岂可空手回天府？","storyCode":"HE-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"015a057515b25727b4bc4bffbfa4797cccff4d91807eb66d687712a8e64a5231","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"耳畔传来一阵琴声，是大脑自我欺骗的幻觉，还是......有谁在为修道院鸣奏？","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一般不会用铳招待客人，特殊情况除外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有哪里招待不周，还请谅解一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（无意义的吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（对我说的话没有任何反应，完全无法沟通吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（身体看起来已经不剩多少人类的特征了，覆盖在身上的那些是鳞？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......这种异变，我记得伊比利亚那边的资料里曾经提过......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道真的是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轮椅还是太不方便了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......奇怪，有哪里不对劲。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它的攻击目标......好像不是我？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它在瞄准哪里？它的目标是——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好险......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......算了，现在管不了这么多了！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能看我是不方便移动的伤员就想欺负人哦，这位客人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的嘶吼）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不行，不能就这么让你逃走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人们在闲聊时总会提起拉特兰。\n他们说那里明亮，富足，人人安居，没有争吵。\n他们说那里是真正的人间乐园。\n其实大家都知道，修道院已经在外漂泊好几十年，真正见过拉特兰的人已经很少了。或许还有那么两三位，或许只剩下主教斯特凡诺。\n人们提起拉特兰，不过是怀念一个早该醒来的梦。\n梦里阳光明媚，鲜花满地。\n就像许多年前，修道院曾展现过的模样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它们快要谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年花开得比往年要早，我猜到谢得应该也会早一些，只是没想到会这么快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚被摘下的那几朵开得很好，还没到凋谢的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真漂亮。是准备送给什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来不及了，已经送不出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们救不了任何人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"悲伤。痛苦。绝望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很复杂的弦音，还有其他的情感藏在你的体内......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在愤怒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢......阿尔图罗小姐是主教阁下的客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是不敢。很坦诚的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的直觉一向非常准确，花匠先生，你似乎有点讨厌我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没这回事，您想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有任何烦恼，我想我可以帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......帮我？呃，我不明白您的意思，阿尔图罗小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这取决于你的想法，而不是由我决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你也可能并不需要什么帮助。你可以指责我多管闲事，也可以说我不怀好意，都没问题，这些都是你说了算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想听听你的想法......你自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是个怪人，阿尔图罗小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你夸我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您刚刚说可以帮我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，只要你需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许您可以......您能帮助很多人，但您帮不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗小姐，难道您能做到起死回生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您能令作物丰收，让冷风停止吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，我不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，您能让我们回到原本的生活，能让那些已经产生的隔阂不再吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您根本做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么你呢，克莱芒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你从没有想过，亲手去解决你所说的这一切问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我试过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是没有办法。我试过不止一次，但我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们越是努力，往往事情就会变得越糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人能让一切都好起来，主教阁下不能，杰拉尔德不能......我也不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您帮不了我，阿尔图罗小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我请您......不要再说这样的话。我也不需要您这样的人的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您问我的想法，那我就告诉您：我什么想法也没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还能想什么？接下来的这个冬天太冷了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒冷。是的，那颗心脏就如一片被冰霜封冻的土壤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我能触到那些潜藏在冰封之下的音符......它们究竟会有多动人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还不到时候，这支乐曲还没到完成的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是多么难熬的忍耐......嗯......在这种时候，我可克制不住自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这首的旋律正合适现在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉过你，你的曲调太规律，太顺遂。你应当明白，顺理成章的旋律总是缺乏令人颤动的情感，既无温度，亦无激情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有时，我也难免有些好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，你究竟什么时候才能意识到......自己因何在追寻呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......琴声？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不对，这不是单纯的琴声，还有源石技艺在其中产生影响。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个源石技艺，以及曲调，难道是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（声音越来越接近了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......在上方？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天这是什么曲子？真好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里每天都能听到乐曲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！您、您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公证所执行者费德里科。请回答我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公证所？那是什么......哦，我知道了，您就是他们说的拉特兰来的客人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这音乐，呃，这段时间偶尔会有吧？我也不太清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！好像是听说在圣堂附近有人拉琴什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣堂在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在顶楼，从外侧的楼梯上去就是——哎，这位、这位客人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受惊吓的居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_940_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑什么......真是个怪人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g4_gatheringplace_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"头儿，你回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，出发准备得怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都差不多了，大家也没多少东西要带，带多了也走不动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过出去探路的小子们还没消息......不知道明早赶不赶得上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和斯特凡诺已经说好，我们要走的事......他不会阻拦。所以不必太急着行动，如果到夜里还没消息，我亲自带队去找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，一会我和大家说一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，头儿！还有个事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼也还没回来......这附近我都找过了，哪里都没见到人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莱蒙德也还没回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，这边交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是赫曼一直不出现，咱们......还等吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最多等到明天早上，参加完晨会，如果到时候人还没回来，你和莱蒙德就按计划带上其他人出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，头儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会留下。活要见人死要见尸，我会找到赫曼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我不会丢下你们中的任何一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们担心的就是你这点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*含糊的发音*，你总往自己身上揽太多东西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那个名字就别提了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们喊我一声头儿，我就有责任带你们找条活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谨慎的萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你是把自己往绝路上逼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我有分寸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，别做这副表情。去吧，都准备起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吓了我一跳......是你啊，斯普莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我还能是谁？费德里科耐烦干这活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"房间里的那姑娘怎么样了......状态很差？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算好。一直没说过话，看起来受的打击不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看了现场，你一点也不好奇到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......大概能猜到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳的威力你我都清楚。这个出血量......是不是人已经不行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表情，看来是我猜对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把这事告诉她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？哦，你说受伤的人可能已经死亡这事？当然没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对方的情绪不稳定，告诉她实情反而会有点麻烦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你是怎么说的？骗她说应该没出事，总之先糊弄过去，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得真不好听......不过，我没什么要反驳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，你的情绪好像有点不对劲。发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和你没关系。我好得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么说，那我就当你没问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那斯普莉雅，这里就交给你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，一个个都是不靠谱的混蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（铳械走火造成的意外......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈，这算什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果当时我没有帮她......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事，简短汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等会，什么叫有萨卡兹出现在外围地带，还在尝试突破你们的封锁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有几个人？是出来探路的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，我知道了。你说奥伦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你们不用管奥伦那边，我会和他联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听我的，接下来你们就这么办......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是......有够能跑的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是追丢了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是从前，这种程度的对手早就该收拾掉了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在这种时候......还是会忍不住稍微有点生气呢。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那边吗......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，现在还不是自怨自艾的时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g4_gatheringplace_d"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g8_outsidepath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（琴声越来越清晰，正在逐步接近来源。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（但源石技艺的强度在减弱，是放弃了施术，还是......嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科先生？您怎么会在这......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是迷路了吗？您不介意的话，我可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？！唔唔唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......刚刚那是什么？那个怪物是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它往下逃了！糟了......那边是杰拉尔德他们住的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人过来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我听到这里有铳声，所以过来碰碰运气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"枢机辅佐官蕾缪安，斯普莉雅的汇报中提及你不会外出行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怪斯普莉雅，我原本确实是那么打算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是遇到了一点意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叙旧先放一边，只有你一个人吗，费德里科？其他人没有和你一起行动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么长话短说，我正在追踪一位忽然出现的......客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，不会耽搁你太久......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，请告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的那位“客人”，它往哪个方向去了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
